      "title": "SMT Engineering Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 348.75 million in funding",
      "body": "SMT Engineering Limited announced a private placement of 1,550,000 Equity Shares at a price per share of INR 225 for gross proceeds of INR 348,750,000 on February 10, 2026. The transaction involves participation from individual investor  Natwarlal Keshavjibhai Kawa for 423,000 shares for INR 95,175,000,  Kunal Haresh Mehta for 288,000 shares for INR 64,800,000,  Bijal Kaushik Gandhi for 209,500 shares for INR 47,137,500,  Jitendra R Sanghavi (Huf) for 200,000 shares for INR 45,000,000, Rasiklal P Sanghavi (Huf) for 200,000 for INR 45,000,000, Nimesh Singh Huf for 103,750 shares for INR 23,343,750,  Priti Nimesh Singh for 103,750 shares for INR 23,343,750 and  Umang Ketan Mehta for 22,000 shares for INR 4,950,000. The company has received approval from Board of Directors of the company.",
